+	-- touches is cut EXACTLY (in strips, BlockMath.RingRects) — the rest of it stays as clones of the part with its
+	-- own colour / size / height, so the rim of the island keeps its voxel outline. The island grass under the yard
+	-- is always taken away (it lay 0.04 under the yard's floor = z-fighting), the deep layers only for a pit.
+	local H = BC.Height
