+-- v2.52: the top (studs above the floor) of the highest solid block in the column of a plot-local
+-- point that is at or below `y` studs (a thing under a roof stands on the floor under it, not on the roof)
+function BlockService.TopYBelow(plot, x, z, y)
+	local blocks = blocksOfPlot(plot)
+	if not blocks or next(blocks) == nil then
+		return 0
